# {{.BinName}} migrations

This directory holds the **{{.BinName}} module's** schema migration files. The
module *owns* its migration files; a **host** runs them (WS-012 composable
services). The `module/module.go` `//go:embed migrations` directive embeds this
directory so a later composed host can run these migrations under a per-module
advisory lock with per-module namespacing.

P1 keeps the standalone host migrating via the ORM in `cmd/{{.BinName}}/main.go`,
so this directory may stay empty until you adopt host-run migrations. This README
is also the placeholder that keeps the `//go:embed migrations` valid before the
first migration file lands.

Add migration files here (e.g. `0001_init.up.sql` / `0001_init.down.sql`) as your
schema evolves.
